didate C is known to be 100% reliable.\" and \"Candidate C creates a positive atmosphere with his crew.\" So Candidate C has reliability and crew cooperation strengths, plus quick correct decisions, calmness. Concerns: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education. But overall seems strong.\n\nThus we can argue that Candidate C may be a better fit than B, because reliability and crew cooperation are strong, and decision quality and calmness are crucial. The communication issues are concerning but perhaps manageable.\n\nThus we can respond: I appreciate Agent 2's recommendation for B, but I think Candidate C's combination of 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, and calmness outweigh B's interpersonal issue. Provide evidence: reliability, crew atmosphere, decision speed, calmness. Concern: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education. But overall fit better.\n\nThus we change recommendation to Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 2's point. Provide evidence from our notes. Then vote for Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
